Rem Joysticks from the keyboard (the cursor keys, Ctrl for fire) in both ports, driven by joystick.input (host only)
Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Open Out 9,"AMOSTEST:out/ready" : Close 9
Print #1,"start";Joy(0);Joy(1)
W=8 : Gosub XQ
W=1 : Gosub XQ
W=18 : Gosub XQ
W=0 : Gosub XQ
Goto FIN
XQ:
T=Timer : Repeat : Wait Vbl : Until Joy(1)=W or Timer-T>500
Print #1,"port 2";Joy(1);" port 1";Joy(0)
Return
FIN:
